### 1) 3.8.20 上解析 app/requirements.txt（干跑；PySide6 无 cp38 轮子，只验证 typing_extensions 标记分支）
$ grep typing_extensions app/requirements.txt
# sys.version_info 显式分支，3.8 走 typing_extensions。
typing_extensions==4.13.2; python_version < "3.9"

$ /tmp/venv38/bin/pip download --dry-run --only-binary=:all: --dest /tmp/dl38 'typing_extensions==4.13.2; python_version < "3.9"'
Successfully downloaded typing_extensions

[notice] A new release of pip is available: 23.0.1 -> 25.0.1
[notice] To update, run: /tmp/venv38/bin/python3.8 -m pip install --upgrade pip

### 2) 3.13 目标：环境标记不生效，pydantic 2.14.3 拉 >=4.16.0
host python: 3.13.5
